---
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SEO } from 'astro-seo';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<meta name="author" content="HuiBeom Jung"/>
	<meta name="keywords" content="LightersGames,Privacy Policy,Data Protection,GDPR,Personal Information"/>
	<SEO 
		title="Privacy Policy - LightersGames"
		description="Privacy Policy for LightersGames and ThanksLight. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
		canonical="https://lightersgames.com/privacy-policy"
		openGraph={{
			basic: {
				title: "Privacy Policy - LightersGames",
				type: "website",
				image: "/img/trailer-img.png",
				url: "https://lightersgames.com/privacy-policy"
			},
			image: {
            alt: "LightersGames Privacy Policy"  
			},
			optional: {
				description: "Privacy Policy for LightersGames and ThanksLight. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
			}
		}}
	/>
	<meta property="twitter:description" content="Privacy Policy for LightersGames and ThanksLight. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
	<meta itemprop="description" content="Privacy Policy for LightersGames and ThanksLight. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
	<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="40x40" href="/favicon-40x40.png" />
	<style is:global>
		@import "../styles/base.css";
	</style>
	<script defer data-domain="lightersgames.com" src="/js/script.js"></script>
	<script>window.plausible = window.plausible || function() { (window.plausible.q = window.plausible.q || []).push(arguments) }</script>
</head>
<body>
	<main>
		<div id="content">
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p><em>Last updated: 2025/6/27</em></p>
			
			<p>
				This Privacy Policy explains how Lightersgames Co., Ltd. (“_Lighters_,” “we,” “our,” or
				“us”) collects, uses, and safeguards information when you play our video games
				(“_Games_”) or interact with our support channels. 
			</p>			
			<p>
				By downloading or playing our Games, you agree to the practices described below.			
			</p>
			
			<h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Company Name: Lightersgames Co., Ltd. </li>
				<li>Registered Address: Lightersgames, 923, 54, Changeop-ro, Sujeong-gu, Seongnamsi, Gyeonggi-do, Republic of Korea</li>
				<ul>
					<li>E-mail: hb@Lightersgames.com</li>
				</ul>
			</ul>
			<p>
				If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA) or the United Kingdom,
				Lightersgames currently has no appointed EU/UK representative. We do not actively
				promote or localize the Games for those regions. Should you nevertheless access the
				Games from the EEA/UK, this policy still applies.
			</p>
			<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
			<div class="table_component" role="region" tabindex="0">
			<table>
				<thead>
					<tr>
						<th>Category</th>
						<th>Data </th>
						<th>Source</th>
						<th>Purpose(§3)</th>
						<th>Legal Basis(EEA)</th>
					</tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<tr>
						<td>Contact Data</td>
						<td>E-mail address, Discord ID (if you contact us)</td>
						<td>User-supplied</td>
						<td>A · C</td>
						<td>Contract</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Device &amp; Diagnostics</td>
						<td>Hardware model, OS version, language, IP address, crash logs</td>
						<td>Game client / Unreal Engine</td>
						<td>B</td>
						<td>Legitimate interest</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Gameplay Data</td>
						<td>Save-files, achievements, playtime, in-game settings</td>
						<td>Local Device ➜ Platform Cloud (Steam, etc.)</td>
						<td>A · B</td>
						<td>Contract</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Purchase Data&nbsp;</td>
						<td>Transaction ID, refund status</td>
						<td>Platform (Steam, PlayStation Store, etc.)</td>
						<td>D</td>
						<td>Legal obligation</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies</td>
						<td>Third-party platforms may use cookies or tracking tools when you access our games.</td>
						<td>Third-party platforms (ex. Steam, PlayStation, Microsoft, Epic Games)</td>
						<td></td>
						<td></td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
			<div style="margin-top:8px">* We do not collect advertising identifiers and we do not build user profiles for marketing purposes.</div>
			
			<h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
			<p>
				A.  Operate the Games and maintain core functionality<br /><br />
				B.  Debug and improve quality (balance tuning, crash fixes)<br /><br />
				C.  Respond to your support requests or feedback<br /><br />
				D.  Meet legal or tax obligations related to purchases and accounting<br /><br />
			</p>
			<div style="margin-top:8px">* We do not sell or share personal information with third parties for cross-context behavioral advertising.</div>
			</div>
			
			<h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Gameplay & diagnostic data: deleted 24 months after your most recent play session. </li>
				<li>Purchase records: kept 5 years to comply with accounting/tax law. </li>
				<li>Support e-mails: removed 12 months after the ticket is closed. </li>
			</ul>

			<h2>5. Third-Pary Services</h2>
			<div class="table_component" role="region" tabindex="0">
			<table>
				<thead>
					<tr>
						<th>Service</th>
						<th>Purpose </th>
						<th>Policy Link</th>
					</tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<tr>
						<td>Steam / Itch.io/ PlayStation / Microsoft / Nintendo / Epic Games Store</td>
						<td>Distribution, cloud saves, achievements, purchases</td>
						<td>
							<ul>
								<li>Steam: https://store.steampowered.com/privacy_agreement/</li>
								<li>Itch.io: https://itch.io/docs/legal/privacy-policy/</li>
								<li>PlayStation: https://www.playstation.com/legal/privacy-policy/</li>
								<li>Nintendo: https://www.nintendo.com/us/privacy-policy/</li>
								<li>Microsoft Store: https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement/</li>
								<li>Epic Games Store: https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/privacypolicy/</li>
							</ul>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Unreal Engine</td>
						<td>Engine diagnostics, crash reporting</td>
						<td>https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/privacypolicy/</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Discord Rich Presence <i>(optional)</i></td>
						<td>Display in-game status to your Discord friends</td>
						<td>https://discord.com/privacy</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
			<div style="margin-top:8px">* These providers may process your data on servers located outside your country (e.g., the United States). Transfers are governed by their own certified safeguards such as
				Standard Contractual Clauses or adequacy decisions.</div>
			</div>

			<h2>6. Children’s Privacy</h2>
			<p>
				Our games are rated 12+ in Korea and are not directed to children under 13.
			</p>
			<p>
				If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child provided personal information
				to us, please contact hb@lightersgames.com to request deletion.
			</p>
			
			<h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
			<p>
				Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to access, correct, delete,
				restrict, or object to the processing of your personal data, and to receive a copy in
				portable form. 
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>How to exercise: Send an e-mail to hb@Lightersgames.com with your request. </li>
				<li>California residents: We do not “sell” or “share” personal information as defined by the CCPA/CPRA, but you may still exercise the rights above. </li>
			</ul>
			
			<h2>8. Security Measures</h2>
			<p>
				We implement reasonable technical and organisational safeguards, including:
				<ul>
					<li>Access-control: only authorised staff can view personal data. </li>
					<li>Regular security reviews of the game builds and third-party SDKs. </li>
				</ul>
				No system is perfectly secure; please do not include sensitive information in bug report attachments.
			</p>
			
			<h2>9. International Data Transfers</h2>
			<p>
				Because our Games rely on global platform services, your data may be transferred to
				and processed in countries that may not offer the same level of data protection as
				your jurisdiction. In such cases, we rely on the platform’s transfer mechanisms (e.g.,
				EU Standard Contractual Clauses).
			</p>
			
			<h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
			<p>
				We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be announced
				in-game or via e-mail at least 30 days before they take effect. The “Last updated”
				date at the top indicates the current version.
			</p>
			

			<h2>Contact Us</h2>
			<p>
				If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, contact:
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>Lightersgames Co., Ltd. </strong><br>
				Email: hb@lightersgames.com<br>
				Address: Lightersgames, 923, 54, Changeop-ro, Sujeong-gu, Seongnam-si, Gyeonggido, Republic of Korea<br>
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		background-color: #242424;
		position: relative;
		max-width: 1920px;
		margin: auto;
		padding-bottom: 4em;
		color: white;
	}

	#content {
		max-width: 80ch;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2ch;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	h1 {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 1em;
		font-size: 2.5em;
		font-weight: 300;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
	}

	h2 {
		margin-top: 2em;
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
		font-size: 1.5em;
		font-weight: 400;
		color: #ffffff;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #444;
		padding-bottom: 0.25em;
	}

	h3 {
		margin-top: 1.5em;
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
		font-size: 1.2em;
		font-weight: 400;
		color: #cccccc;
	}

	p {
		margin-bottom: 1em;
		text-align: left;
	}

	ul {
		margin-bottom: 1em;
		padding-left: 2em;
	}

	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}

	em {
		color: #aaaaaa;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	strong {
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	/* Responsive styles */
	@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
		#content {
			padding: 1ch;
			max-width: 95%;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 2em;
		}

		h2 {
			font-size: 1.3em;
		}

		h3 {
			font-size: 1.1em;
		}
	}

	@media screen and (max-width: 500px) {
		#content {
			padding: 0.8ch;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 1.8em;
			letter-spacing: 1px;
		}
	}

	.table_component {
		overflow: auto;
		width: 100%;
	}
	
	.table_component table {
		border: 1px solid #3c3c49;
		height: 100%;
		width: 100%;
		table-layout: auto;
		border-collapse: collapse;
		border-spacing: 1px;
		text-align: center;
	}
	
	.table_component caption {
		caption-side: top;
		text-align: left;
	}
	
	.table_component th {
		border: 1px solid #3c3c49;
		background-color: #eceff1;
		color: #000000;
		padding: 5px;
}

.table_component td {
    border: 1px solid #3c3c49;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #000000;
    padding: 5px;
}
</style>